    "intro": "Setting up as a landscaper or gardener? This **landscaping business name generator** has catchy puns, classic family names, names from trees and wildflowers, modern studio names and elegant ones for garden design, plus names from your town or your first name.",
    "sections": [],
    "faqs": [
      {
        "question": "How do I check a landscaping business name is free?",
        "answer": "Press <strong>Check</strong> next to any name to see if it's free as a company, a domain and a social media handle. Then make sure: in the UK, search Companies House and the UK IPO trade mark register; in the US, search your state's business register and the USPTO trade mark search. A quick map search for the name in your area helps too."
      },
      {
        "question": "What's the difference between a landscaping and a lawn care business name?",
        "answer": "Landscapers design and build gardens (planting, patios, borders), so their names lean on gardens, nature and design. Lawn care firms mow and treat turf, so their names are about lawns, mowing and stripes. If mowing is most of your work, try the <a href=\"lawn-care-business-name-generator.html\">Lawn Care Business Name Generator</a>."
      }
